    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Andreia Gaudêncio","jobTitle":"CNCA Project Internal Leader","description":"Andreia Gaudêncio has a PhD in biomedical engineering and is currently the CNCA Project Internal Leader for the BSC AI Factory project — a European initiative offering free access to an incubation program, computational resources, data- and software-related services, and technical support.\\n\\nWithin Data and AI technical support, Andreia works hands-on with startups, SMEs, and researchers to harness High-Performance Computing (HPC) and AI for accelerating innovation, guiding teams through the Deucalion and MareNostrum supercomputers and the project's data-related services.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/backfill/andreia-gaudencio.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"BSC AI Factory"}}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Paulo Andrez","jobTitle":"Angel Investor & Author","description":"Paulo is a seasoned entrepreneur turned angel investor, bestselling author of Zero Risk Startup (Forbes Books), and President Emeritus of the European Business Angel Network.","image":"https://img1.wsimg.com/isteam/ip/6685a3b4-9cd6-4f4a-9967-066ceb7c6eda/NEF_6456.jpg/:/cr=t:5.5%25,l:0%25,w:100%25,h:89%25/rs=w:400,h:533,cg:true","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Zero Risk Startup"},"sameAs":["https://linkedin.com/in/pauloandrez"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Luis Valente","jobTitle":"CEO & Co-Founder","description":"Forbes 30 Under 30 entrepreneur, strategist, and business manager with a Computer Science background, driven to solve complex problems. My entrepreneurial journey began at 18, and since them have been founding ventures focused on demand prediction, lean operations, and growth design. Believing in technology's power to democratize personalized medicine, I co-founded iLoF - a deep tech company using AI to build a cloud-based library of disease biomarkers. On a mission to accelerate adequate treatments for millions living with complex, heterogeneous diseases globally.","image":"https://startupsummit.io/images/speakers/luis-valente.jpeg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"iLoF"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/luisvalente28/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Anmol Goel","jobTitle":"CEO & Partner","description":"With a sharp eye for high-potential founders and a background in finance and entrepreneurship, Anmol brings a fresh, global perspective to venture investing.","image":"https://startupsummit.io/images/speakers/anmol-goel.png","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Gacs Ltd & Gacsym Ventures"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/anmol-g-215a96a9/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Karan Setiya","jobTitle":"Fintech Venturing Manager","description":"Fintech Venturing at ABN AMRO, early stage investor, ex-BCG, former edTech founder (built and scaled Veduo to 10k users, sunsetted)","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/public/3eee2e5a-7815-499a-a3b6-0f02615b59d5/karan-setiya.png","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"ABN AMRO Bank"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/karansetiya/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Rita Kastrati","jobTitle":"CEO and Founder","description":"Rita Kastrati is the founder of Pioneering People, a platform connecting businesses with verified flexible staff instantly, while ensuring workers are paid fairly and on the same day. Growing up in hospitality, she experienced first-hand the challenges of last-minute staffing, which led her to build a faster, fairer way to work. Today, Pioneering People operates across 20+ UK cities, supporting over 10,000 workers and a growing network of businesses. Rita is also building a community of young founders through her 15 Under 30 events and is passionate about shaping the future of flexible work.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/backfill/d90ad62b-8b3a-4602-b05d-06358e4936a9.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Pioneering People"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/rita-kastrati99/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Luis Gutman","jobTitle":"Managing Partner","description":"Luis Felipe Gutman is the Managing Partner at OW Ventures, a Lisbon-based venture capital firm where he leverages over 20 years of experience in technology and innovation to invest in early-stage startups across Portugal, Europe and Brazil. A seasoned executive with a background in digital transformation and agile leadership, he has held key roles in international corporations and startups, specializing in sectors like SportsTech and Impact Investments.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/luis-gutman.png","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"OW Ventures SCR"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/luisgutman/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Héctor LV","jobTitle":"Head of Corporate & Legal Counsel","description":"Héctor López Vázquez is Head of Corporate at Lexidy Law Boutique, a pan-European law firm with offices across Spain, Portugal, France, Italy, and Greece. He specialises in cross-border M&A, fundraising structures, and European market entry — advising founders and investors at the intersection of legal strategy and business execution. He also teaches entrepreneurship, financing, and international expansion at ISDE Law Business School and mentors startups at Madrid International Lab.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/backfill/a2af2efa-7683-432b-97e0-b5dd81c170ed.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Lexidy Law Boutique SLP"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/hector-lopez-vzqz/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Tina Valand","jobTitle":"Generative AI Director","description":"Tina is a Generative AI Director at Accenture leading Gen AI centres of excellence and Agentic AI. She has been working with clients in Financial services, Media and Retail with over 20 year in innovation, fintech and leading technology transformation. She is leading conversational AI ecosystem partners including Boost.Ai & ElevenLabs. She works closely with Fintech and innovation labs and was Tech 100 Women Uk and Women in Fintech award winner. She is the co founder of Women in Alliances and was recently featured in Forbes for her work in creating inclusive networks. She also works with entrepreneurs as part of a digital membership club called 1 club supporting the new generation of talent","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/public/cabc2ee9-ff4d-465c-9886-acb3d625cf7c/1779108769917.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Accenture"},"sameAs":["https://uk.linkedin.com/in/tina-valand-b191a42"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Vini Devnani","jobTitle":"Fractional Head of People","description":"Fractional Head of People, provide start-up and scale ups with practical skills to hire effectively, build culture and design organisations with humans in the loop. Previously built a HR function globally and scales a company from 30-150 in two years.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/vini-devnani.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"JAB Holdings"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/vini-d-445a771b/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Luiza Castro Rey","jobTitle":"Partner & Co-Founder & Head of Corporate and Web3","description":"Luiza Castro Rey represents a new generation of legal leadership — one that combines technical rigour with strategic vision and human understanding. Educated at PUC-Rio and holding a Master’s in International and Commercial Law from the University of Lisbon, she has built an international career spanning Europe and the Americas. In 2022, she co-founded FiO Legal alongside four partners, driven by the belief that law should actively shape the future of business. As Head of Corporate & Web3, she leads complex work involving digital assets, emerging regulation, and innovative business structures. A speaker, mediator, and entrepreneur, Luiza is recognised for transforming legal practice into a tool for growth, accessibility, and innovation.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/luiza-castro-rey.jpeg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Fio Legal"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/luiza-reycastro/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Nashwa Shah","jobTitle":"Founder, philanthropist and motivational speaker","description":"Nashwa is public speaker and cultural commentator. With a vibrant career spanning hospitality, venture capital and creator\nculture, she now works globally with\nentrepreneurs, influencers and\nbrands to shape and scale their social\nmedia presence.\nShe has driven innovation and\nmarketing for the worldʼs first\ninvite-only digital private membersʼ\nclub and advises major FMCG brands\nand a curated roster of influential\nfigures on brand and growth strategy.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/nashwa-shah.jpeg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Many"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/nashwa-shah-1322251b0?utm_source=share_via&utm_content=profile&utm_medium=member_ios"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Rita Figueiredo","jobTitle":"HEAD OF PORTUGAL","description":"II am a seasoned legal professional committed to making law accessible, transparent, and impactful. With extensive experience in Litigation, Banking, Financial, Corporate, Urban and Immigration Law. Guided by integrity, authenticity, and fearless leadership, I strive to simplify complexities, create meaningful change, and empower both individuals and businesses. As Legal Director for Lexidy’s Lisbon and Porto offices, I lead national and international strategies, fostering collaboration, innovation, and cross-disciplinary excellence. Passionate about delivering seamless 360° legal services, I focus on creating strategic solutions that drive clarity, growth, and opportunity. Fluent in English and Portuguese, I build trust and bridge gaps, ensuring law becomes a catalyst for progress.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/optimized/rita-figueiredo.webp","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"LEXIDY"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/rita-figueiredo/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Filipa Faria","jobTitle":"People & Culture Transformation Leader","description":"With an international career across Canada, US, Portugal, Spain, UK, and France, I’ve worked in organizations in sectors such as construction, healthcare, banking, technology, legal, retail, and both public and private sectors. From scaling startups to guiding established corporations, I’ve seen one truth: organizations grow when their people do.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/optimized/filipa-faria.webp","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Fio Legal | Fractional Freelance HR"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/filipaffaria/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Ricardo","jobTitle":"Speaker","description":"CEO Startup Summit Lisbon 2026.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/public/46903ead-7e6e-4104-8e7e-545cedffd82c/ricardo-1782000000.jpeg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Startup Summit"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/ricardopascual84/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Raffaella Loncao","jobTitle":"Founder & Managing Director","description":"I'm Raffaella Loncao, a Lisbon-based founder and Managing Director of On This Planet, a strategic people advisory firm that helps climate and nature scale-ups build the leadership, culture, and organisation they need to grow and expand.\n\nBefore this, I spent over twenty years as an international Chief People Officer in luxury at Gucci and Saint Laurent, building people infrastructure at global level. I sit on the Advisory Board of Women in Sustainable Luxury.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/public/80ea7c97-a0ab-4575-8059-9d30fa09f413/1781699385500.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"On This Planet"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/raffaellaloncao/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Muhammad Farooq Rathod","jobTitle":"CEO & Founder","description":"Serial Entrepreneur & Startup Founder | Driving Digital Business Transformation | Global Award Winner | Investor, Mentor & Author (US & Europe)","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/muhammad-farooq-rathod.jpeg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"UpStride Holdings"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/muhammad-farooq-rathod-3158001b/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Zoya Mesaric","jobTitle":"Executive Coach, Psychoanalyst & Trauma Specialist","description":"Zoya Mesaric is an Executive Coach, Psychoanalyst, and Trauma Specialist working internationally across Vienna, Lisbon, and London. She helps founders, executives, and high-performing professionals navigate leadership, identity, performance, and psychological resilience. Her work has been presented at the World Congress for Psychotherapy, and she is a regular contributor to Elle Slovenia.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/zoya-mesaric.png","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Zoya Mesaric – Private International Practice"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/zoya-mesaric-mag-a-pth-461259242?utm_source=share_via&utm_content=profile&utm_medium=member_ios"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Alexandra Isenegger","jobTitle":"Founder & Managing Director","description":"Founder & MD of Linkilaw Solicitors, a boutique Mayfair law firm specialising in complex, high-profile international disputes. Forbes 30 Under 30 honouree and The Times/LDC Top 50 To Watch. Over a decade advising entrepreneurs, investors, family offices and business leaders where law, leadership and international growth intersect. I speak on conscious leadership, organisational culture, entrepreneurship, cross-border business, and building values-driven organisations. My experience spans complex international structures, cross-border disputes and long-term growth strategies across multiple jurisdictions — with significant engagement in the UAE and wider Middle East. I deliver actionable insights grounded in real-world experience for audiences of founders, executives and investors.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/backfill/c3fcf2f3-0bf1-4b95-b942-aaa6a23c71b3.png","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Linkilaw Solicitors, CBCA Group"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/alexandraisenegger/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Viachaslau Smirnou","jobTitle":"CEO & Co-founder","description":"A senior PR & Marketing leader with 15+ years of hands-on experience in IT and tech-driven companies. CEO and Co-Founder of Around PR Studio - PR and communications agency specializing in startup visibility, investment PR, and AI-era reputation strategy for tech and AI companies operating in the US and Europe.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/viachaslau-smirnou.jpg?v=1","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Around PR Studio"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/viachaslau-smirnou-b173068a?originalSubdomain=pl"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Román Knörr Durán","jobTitle":"Marketing & Brand Strategist","description":"A Marketing & Brand Strategist focused on consumer psychology and neuromarketing, drawing on experience working with SMEs across Spain on positioning, go-to-market strategy, and digital presence.\n\nRomán graduated with honours in Marketing from Universidad Complutense de Madrid, with academic and professional focus on how brands build trust and drive decisions at the point of choice.\n\nAt Startup Summit, he'll bring that lens to a practical question: how teams and founders can build real brand equity and go-to-market traction without a big budget behind them.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/backfill/d7dc9b88-fdbb-41f0-8f72-311c938391d3.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Román Knörr"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/román-knörr-durán-42147b235"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Akshay Ruparelia","jobTitle":"CEO & Co-Founder","description":"Akshay is a serial entrepreneur and Forbes 30 Under 30 Europe alumnus who founded Doorsteps at 17; an online estate agency that sold over £1 billion in property and saved customers £15 million in fees. A former free school meals pupil and carer to his deaf parents, he has built his career around commercial impact and social purpose. He founded AKR Growth, an OFSTED-regulated social enterprise helping disadvantaged young people into employment, and serves on the board of the Prince's Trust RISE Campaign. He now leads Brdge, an Emerging Tech Consultancy & Venture Studio delivering GenAI and blockchain solutions globally.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/akshay-ruparelia.jpg?v=1","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Brdge"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/akshay-ruparelia/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Saachin Bhatt","jobTitle":"CIO & Co-founder","description":"Saachin Bhatt CITP MBCS is a serial entrepreneur, innovation strategist, and keynote speaker who joined Accenture at 18 as a data scientist, becoming one of their youngest consultants globally by 21, delivering £15M in impact across national security, aerospace, and tier-1 banks. The youngest ever to achieve Chartered IT Professional status under the Royal Charter, he co-founded Brdge, an award-winning global consultancy and venture studio helping startups, scaleups, and SMEs access world-class AI and emerging tech expertise. He advises Fortune 500 CEOs on AI strategy and is Vice Chair & Governor at one of the UK's top-performing secondary schools.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/saachin-bhatt.jpg?v=1","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Brdge"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/saachinbhatt/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Dina Kondratiuk","jobTitle":"CEO & founder","description":"Founder of Solegency, helping startup founders build clarity in their pitches to investors and customers. Previously at Techstars Berlin, I supported early-stage founders with Go-to-Market strategy and fundraising across EU and US markets. Over my career, I have built two business accelerator programs and managed a portfolio of 150 startups with a total implied valuation of $150M+.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/public/3f9438f1-accf-40db-801c-29e443b01162/1781280361511.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Solegency"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/dinadea/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"João Ramos","jobTitle":"Innovation Orchestrator","description":"Ex-founder, angel investor, and corporate innovator, I specialize in corporate venturing by bridging corporations with the startup ecosystem to drive new revenue streams, strategic partnerships, and long-term impact.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/05ff4563-c437-4f62-a85e-cf5eb6b584c9.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Fast Track Ventures"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/joaofmramos/"]}</script>
