    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Diego Sampaio","jobTitle":"CEO","description":"Entrepreneur for over 20 years, Diego is co-founder and CEO of Globalfy, a company that has helped over 10,000 international entrepreneurs from over 100 countries open and operate businesses in the United States. Diego has spent nearly 11 years selling into the U.S. market and building the infrastructure that allows founders from anywhere in the world to compete globally from day one.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/9fa4d986-5aeb-48c1-8610-cdfe1c92b11f.png","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Globalfy"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/diegosampaio/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Amit Grinvald","jobTitle":"Communication Strategist & Public Speaking Coach","description":"Communication strategist for leaders and founders. Works with both founders and VCs on fund narratives, having supported fundraising rounds of €80M+. Mentor at Google for Startups and Founder Institute. Has led conversations at TED, SXSW London, and South Summit. Founder of TEDxUNYP, one of Europe's most recognised TEDx events, with several talks in the global Top 100.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/d85d2b8a-e936-4bdc-8c5e-a9a60daa3b9e.png","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Independent"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/amit-grinvald-0655066a/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Janelle Harder","jobTitle":"CEO & Founder","description":"Janelle Harder, based in Croatia, is the Founder of Humannovate Consulting. Over the past 15 years, she's trained, advised and coached 1,000+ leaders at global Fortune 500 companies (with revenues $54B+). She now helps leaders of startups across 9 countries by coaching them on how their behaviour and demeanor is impacting the results of their businesses. Through a focus on culture, leadership, and human behaviour, she helps leaders scale their businesses by seeing how they're getting in their own way to lead more effectively.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/public/503e709f-6934-4492-8096-18c1fee521f9/1783499372118.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Humannovate Consulting"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/janelleharder"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Kasia Szczesniak","jobTitle":"Founder","description":"Kasia Szczesniak is the founder of Lisbon Business Leaders, specializing in leadership development and transformation. With over 15 years of experience leading marketing strategy for global brands, including Google, and now as a founder herself, her passion for leadership comes from experiencing firsthand the challenges and opportunities of leading in both corporate and entrepreneurial environments. Today, she supports founders and executives in developing the leadership capacity needed to navigate complexity, drive transformation, and thrive in an AI-driven world through a human-first approach to leadership.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/5505d436-c7e9-45d3-893b-d70c1132824a.png","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Lisbon Business Leaders"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/kasiaszczesniak/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Lisa Rebecca Press","jobTitle":"Founder","description":"Lisa Press is a finance leader and Founder of Lisa Press Consulting, helping startups and scaling companies improve reporting, automate manual processes, and build finance functions that support better decision making. Her background spans Big 4 audit, Silicon Valley consulting, SaaS finance, FP&A, fundraising, and senior finance leadership, with experience at companies including Stripe and Monta. She is passionate about helping founders turn finance from a reactive back office function into a strategic driver of smarter growth.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/f30a1e54-8ca7-41ed-a9db-83d81d89c103.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Lisa Press Consulting"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/lisa-press-cpa-fmva/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"David Graham","jobTitle":"Managing Partner","description":"David Graham has spent 25 years as a founder, including four exits. He now runs Dyrectli Capital, an early-stage investment syndicate and advisory firm that connects post-MVP founders to capital and invests alongside exited founders and HNWIs. He reviews 3,000+ decks a year, has made around 40 investments over the past three years, and advises early-stage founders on what actually generates cash or closes deals.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/d7e0bd47-8f63-47ac-8300-e18bd140f224.png","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Dyrectli Capital"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/dguk/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Igor Nikolaiev","jobTitle":"Co-founder and Chief Product & Technology Officer","description":"I'm Co-founder and CPTO at Aiffin, an AI-native fintech company building the next generation of AI digital infrastructure for SME financing and Underwriting.\n\nI lead product strategy and technology, focusing on applying AI to automate financial decision-making.\n\nIn 2025, Aiffin raised €3.1 million in debt and equity, obtained French JEI status, and joined Station F in Paris. In 2026, I was endorsed by Tech Nation and recognized by the UK Government as an Exceptional Global Talent in Digital Technology.\n\nI built and scaled technology products across fintech, AI, Web3, SaaS and digital identity. My experience includes developing platforms used by millions of users, building financial infrastructure, and designing AI-powered systems for credit decisioning, risk assessment, KYC and AML.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/861f2b9e-9812-4e80-8a42-f264471a893b.png","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Aiffin"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/igornikolaiev/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Precy Servito","jobTitle":"Founder","description":"Precy is a Global Organizational Strategist. Founder of KONNECT, an AI and human strategy execution workspace built for the way startups, scale-ups, and SMBs actually operate, and Founder and Principal Consultant of KAPWA Global, a consulting practice specializing in organizational resilience and change management. Precy has led transformation across workforces of up to 60K+ employees globally, in senior roles spanning Asia, Europe, and the Americas. Precy works at the intersection of AI capability and human judgment for founders and operators navigating fast-moving organizations.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/31d188c8-edca-491f-8ce4-cbc6ee63a08c.png","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"KONNECT - AI + Human Strategy Execution Workspace"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/precyservito"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Irina Shurmina","jobTitle":"Founder","description":"Irina Shurmina is a founder of Ladies Who Talk community and Talk Academy – a curated expert platform for business trainings and events. \n\nIrina is a community strategist, networking expert, business development consultant, speaker and moderator.\n\nBefore moving into entrepreneurship, she spent 14+ years in international law firms as Counsel and Head of Practice at CMS, BCLP, and other firms, working with clients including Nike, Clarins, Nestlé, MARS, Cisco, TEVA, Johnson & Johnson, and Unilever.\n\nAlongside her legal career, Irina built professional communities, educational programmes, conferences, and networking formats — including co-founding one of the largest legal communities with 5000+ members.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/public/1b29f5ab-d4d0-4597-bf6d-5d91f2119f92/1784537238828.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Ladies Who Talk"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/irina-shurmina/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Jorge Sebastiao","jobTitle":"CEO and Co-founder","description":"International Speaker, author, ecosystems builder, investor, startups in innovation: AI, Web3, XR, Gaming, Sustainability, RWA, CyberSecurity, 5G, Robotics. Founder of EcoX and Bombastic Burgh. Author MBC Book.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/544cb986-1398-4617-84b7-82f0e829e92a.png","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Ecox / Bombastic Burgh"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/sebastiao"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Anisha Yadav","jobTitle":"Founder","description":"Anisha Yadav is a cross-industry go-to-market advisor who helps early-stage founders turn founder-led selling into a repeatable revenue engine. With 15+ years across product marketing, account management, and revenue — including accountability for a $100M+ ARR portfolio — she runs First Ten, guiding 0→1 founders through her \"Earn the Right to Scale\" method. She mentors at various SF-based accelerators, helping European founders break into North America.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/327a4c60-e2e2-4700-ace5-c82bc24944bb.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"First Ten Advisory"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/anishayadav/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Lauren Mucklow","jobTitle":"Co-Founder","description":"Lauren Mucklow is the Co-Founder & Lead Consultant of What She Said, a growth consultancy supporting female service‑based business owners at every stage of their journey. With over two decades of senior leadership experience in the Brand Experience agency world, Lauren specialises in helping founders gain strategic clarity, stronger positioning and sustainable commercial growth.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/450ab5de-aef1-419e-a5cf-83724ebe36c8.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"What She Said Limited"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/laurenmucklow/"]}</script>
