    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Sibilla Strupule","jobTitle":"CEO & Founder","description":"Pitch authority. Serial founder with one exit, 20+ international pitch competition wins, Forbes-featured.\nShe's coached 500+ founders whose companies have raised over €70M. An European Innovation Council (EIC) Tech-to-Market mentor and international pitch competition judge, she's spoken at UN and World Bank events and advises founders and executives across Europe on delivering premium pitches that captivate audiences, investors and close rounds.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/f0d00ac2-d057-42f2-a6e9-9d5d39ed2d6f.png","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"SibillaStrupule.com"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/sibillastrupule/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Mark Paul Haaksman","jobTitle":"Co-Founder/ Fundraiser","description":"With over 25 years of experience, I am the Co-Founder and Fund Leader of Sotavento Invest and  the Circular Hub Algarve, focusing on supporting startups in South Portugal. My work centers on providing impact investing, SMART money, and fostering innovation. I have helped finance and co-create value in pre-seed and seed-stage startups, connecting them to the broader entrepreneurial ecosystem.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/f598eca5-71dd-4347-a956-ed81883eb709.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Sotavento Angels Fund"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/mark-p-haaksman-765121/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Micael Lopes","jobTitle":"CEO & Founder","description":"Founder of TIME & SPACE. On a mission to enable more presence and connection to people at events.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/fa66e6be-f3f6-453b-871b-ec311b0145b9.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"TIME & SPACE"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/micaelopes/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Satya Morarji","jobTitle":"Founder","description":"Satya Morarji is a speaker coach, leadership mentor and entrepreneur who helps leaders communicate with greater authenticity, clarity and influence.\n\nA double Silver Medallist at the UK & Ireland Public Speaking Championships, his work centres on helping people discover their natural communication style so they can lead with confidence rather than performance and this has lead to him delivering workshops at the United Nations.\n\nAway from the stage, Satya has founded businesses spanning virtual staffing, hospitality and e-commerce, giving him first-hand experience of leading teams, building organisations and communicating through uncertainty. His coaching blends practical leadership experience with storytelling, deep curiosity and powerful questioning.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/3c788132-57c6-49b5-89a8-a03a6c07c9c2.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Freedom VAs"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/satya-morarji/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Tania Tome","jobTitle":"American Business Awards® Judge, Global KeynoteSpeaker, Advisor, Innovation Catalyst & Author","description":"Tânia Tomé is an internationally recognized Lusophone keynote speaker, economist, author and entrepreneur who has inspired audiences in more than 22 countries across Africa, Europe, North America and South America. She is Chair of the AI & Technology, New Product & Service, and Sustainability Awards Judging Committee for the 2026 Stevie® Awards for Women in Business, held in New York, and the first Lusophone and African woman to chair a Global Women in Business Awards judging committee in New York. A former Forbes Coaches Council member and recipient of an Academic Award presented by former Portuguese President Mário Soares, she serves as advisor, board member and international judge for several global initiatives.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/cd0d0c2d-80d1-4946-add4-fbe077560864.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"BRANDULOGY"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/taniatome/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Angelee SIDAR","jobTitle":"Founder","description":"Angelee Sidar is an entrepreneur, keynote speaker and executive coach who helps founders \"scale themselves so that they can scale their businesses.\"\nAfter leaving a corporate career, Angelee built a contract catering company that disrupted a legacy industry, replacing soulless service with experiences centred on health and community. Within three years it reached seven figures and 12+ locations, working with brands including Nike, Adidas, IWG Group and Spaces, before the pandemic brought it to an end.\nThat loss became the catalyst for a deeper journey, reshaping how she saw ambition and success. Today she draws on neuroscience, nervous system regulation and her R.E.F. Method™ to help founders lead with clarity and build purpose.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/d9a800d3-7e60-4996-b0c0-fface2f6a72f.png","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"FIIYS Ltd"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/angelee-sidar-605a1a70/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Ben Lakoff","jobTitle":"Managing Partner","description":"Ben Lakoff, CFA is the Managing Partner of Bankless Ventures, an early-stage venture fund backed by Marc Andreessen, Chris Dixon, and dozens of leading founders and GPs. The firm currently manages two active funds.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/4d4ce03f-31df-4469-bb95-7ca2e138c366.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Bankless Ventures"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/benlakoff"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Rita Martins Freire","jobTitle":"Marketing, CX & Growth Transformation Leader","description":"Marketing, Customer Experience & Growth Transformation Executive with 30+ years of international experience helping organisations drive sustainable growth across global markets. She has led strategic marketing, customer experience, transformation and commercial initiatives across multinational organisations, startups and entrepreneurial ventures, working across Europe and Asia. She is the Founder of TRIVEVO, a strategic advisory launching soon to help SMEs, startups and scale-ups Build, Transform and Scale for sustainable growth. Her perspective combines business strategy, marketing, customer experience and growth, with a strong focus on creating value, building reputation and driving sustainable business performance.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/public/2e1ae6ed-f46c-4258-bcf0-2e3afe1f228d/1787824282015.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Trivevo"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/ritamartinsfreire"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Sebastian Horstmann","jobTitle":"CTO & Co-Founder","description":"Sebastian Horstmann is Co-Founder and CTO of Cosysense, where he leads the technical architecture behind an AI-native operating system for building energy and operations. His work spans real-time IoT telemetry pipelines, HVAC control and optimization, and the data infrastructure that lets multi-site operators like quick-service restaurant chains monitor and automate energy use at scale. Sebastian is focused on turning fragmented building data into a unified platform that drives measurable energy savings and operational efficiency across hundreds of sites.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/f6054a22-5d37-4320-844d-576f8f5bdbcf.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Cosysense"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/s-horstmann/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Sofia Bobrik","jobTitle":"Founder & CEO","description":"I help B2B founders and infrastructure companies turn communications into a business function. Not \"getting coverage\" but making sure that when an investor, enterprise client, or partner checks you out (and they always do), what they find closes the deal for you. The outcomes I work toward: warmer fundraising conversations, shorter enterprise sales cycles, and a category where your name comes up first.","image":"https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/D4E03AQEUmq8mv0czJw/profile-displayphoto-scale_400_400/B4EZ5AHaU5H0Ak-/0/1779192149008?e=1789603200&v=beta&t=Iy62oNvyJU77jKEXWHyfSSjreiaD5B-wM70LEW_z6jc","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"PR Agency TechWaves"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/sofia-bobrik/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Pedro Simões","jobTitle":"Entrepreneur","description":"Was an online Fitness Coach, been a Closer for B2B and B2C companies, I’m a Human behaviour and Psychology enthusiast, I’m starting my journey as a philanthropist now, joined the board of JCI recently.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/ec836e81-87b1-48ee-825b-e607bd95bd5c.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"JCI"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/opedrosimoes?utm_source=share_via&utm_content=profile&utm_medium=member_ios"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Sylvie Ritt","jobTitle":"Co-Founder","description":"Sylvie is an energetic activator personality. \n\nShe is an athelete, longevity expert, International business and personal re-invention coach. \nYou will feel the spark instantly - she inspires you to connect with your authentic self to discover what you are truly capable of - to live your most purposeful life.\n\n\"Tap into your highest, most vibrant version.\"","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/c8c2ba86-7aa8-4aab-b647-18b168e9fd8b.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Time to Rise"},"sameAs":["http://www.linkedin.com/in/sylvie-ritt-sp-12b261a5"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Daniel Grech","jobTitle":"AI Enablement Consultant","description":"Daniel Grech is an AI enablement consultant based in Lisbon. He works with large enterprises and startups to become AI native, embedding agentic AI into day to day operations rather than leaving it in pilots. He co-founded Wyzer, acquired by ZignSec, where he served as Group CTO through 2025. His engagements span fintech, banking and risk management, delivering measurable results such as a 24% cut in cycle time and a 45% faster path to production. Daniel specialises in regulated industries where automation has to screen and triage without overstepping into automated decisions. He speaks on \"multi-threading the workforce\", the case for running AI agents across a business. He holds an MSc in Statistics and has spoken at ICE London and DELTA Summit.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/6ed5b708-ef2b-41bd-bfd2-67c40093140d.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Self-Employed"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/daniel-grech-8bb32a24/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Elias Flachowsky","jobTitle":"Co-Founder","description":"At just 23 years old and a lifelong sports enthusiat, Elias spreads high energy naturally. \n\nHe is building his own entrepreneurial journey with one clear mission: helping people stop waiting and start taking action.\nHis dynamic presence and relentless drive inspires you to challenge limiting beliefs, embrace responsibility and unlock unseen potential.\n\n\"Action changes lives. Waiting doesn't.\"","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/a83b142d-a64a-4c15-9cba-bd0114ea8a22.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Time to Rise"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/elias-flachowsky-bb090542b"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Kristina Kutan","jobTitle":"COO","description":"Kristina is COO at VNTR, where she works at the intersection of venture, private capital, and organizational design. Previously, she built and exited her own startup, and today much of her work focuses on building smarter operating systems while keeping human judgment at the center.\n\nAlongside her operating role, Kristina works with leaders and teams through strategic facilitation, leadership sessions, and development programs, advocating for a new generation of leadership that combines structure, adaptability, and human intelligence.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/435d1656-938c-47b8-9d64-d32b3338741d.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"VNTR Capital"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/kristinakutan/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Hudi Shehu","jobTitle":"Founding Chairman","description":"Hudi Shehu is the Founder & Chairman of Postjer Group, a UK-based advisory holding with three subsidiaries and 11 UK awards, and of Business Network Albania, the world’s largest network connecting Albanian entrepreneurs, investors, and executives across Tirana, London, Berlin, New York, and beyond. He has advised and mentored 51+ startup founders, owns three companies, and serves as a board member to seven  companies, while speaking globally on leadership, neuromarketing, community building, and diaspora engagement.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/731bc35c-3c00-4a61-b4db-a373048e3c16.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Business Network Albania"},"sameAs":["https://linkedin.com/in/hudishehu"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Alexandre Daletchine","jobTitle":"CEO & Foudner","description":"I'm a TEDx speaker working on how founders and leaders generate ideas and make decisions when there's no precedent to copy. I built the Creativity Archetype Method (CAM) with the aid of AI — a diagnostic across 8 archetypes that identifies how a person creates and what blocks them, with a 3-minute version at quiz.daletchine.com. I spent my career among divergent thinkers, artists and collectors, advising on art investment: capital allocation under uncertainty, the same challenge founders in this room face. I lectured at La Cambre in Brussels and have led interviews and moderated panels with artists and entrepreneurs at Art Basel, the Sovereign Art Foundation, in New York, Moscow and Riyadh. \n(Based in Lisbon)","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/48e5d972-fb16-4858-8b66-445a9c9447b3.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Creativity Matter"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/alexandre-daletchine-91185213/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Slavi Slavev","jobTitle":"Founder, AI Lead","description":"Slavi is a 2x founder. He co-founded BLITAB, the world's first tactile tablet for blind people, opening the digital world to millions often excluded from it, and later RASK, a 10-minute pharmacy delivery startup in the Nordics. His work has been featured in The New York Times, BBC, MIT Technology Review and CNBC, and he served as a judge for MIT Solve. Today he leads AI adoption in $500M+ revenue companies across different sectors.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/787606c7-e157-4ce9-95c1-2c6ccf98babe.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Independent"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/sslavev/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Wouter Heijnen","jobTitle":"co-Founder and Startup Scout","description":"Wouter Heijnen co-founder of Sotavento Invest - the go-to fund for early stage investment in the Algarve. Wouter is a seasoned entrepreneur and innovator with a background in healthcare, government innovation, and early-stage brand building. As a co-founder of Sotavento Invest, a fund of funds, he combines his strengths in marketing, branding, and creativity to support impact-driven ventures through funding, mentorship, and infrastructure.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/91ebe3b0-d415-463a-a424-461b07357e37.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Sotavento Invest"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/wtrhnn"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Diogo Mendonça","jobTitle":"Investor - Tech Exec","description":"15+ years building and scaling Tech/ICT companies / Investor @Angels Way / Venture Partner & Advisor / Builder at heart","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/a89d25d1-538b-4889-87a3-674b5625180b.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Angels Way"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/dimend/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Lidija Krickovic","jobTitle":"CEO & Founder","description":"Lidija Krickovic is the founder of Growth Geek and creator of the 20-Week Foundational Fixes Program, which helps post-raise and scaling companies replace operational chaos with the foundations required for sustainable growth. Across more than 20 years, she has led teams of 200+, grown annual profit from $10M to $24M as a CEO, and taken a venture from inception to a €20M+ valuation in under ten months. She also led internal execution and due diligence for a $40.8M exit, giving her a hands-on perspective on operational efficiency, scaling, and building companies with long-term enterprise value in mind.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/370c0a7a-63bc-4638-8164-5aa6a7b7d441.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Growth Geek Unipessoal LDA"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/lidijakrickovic/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Ed Chandler","jobTitle":"Founder & Principal Advisor","description":"Ed Chandler is a TOPGUN graduate and former instructor at the US Navy's centre of excellence for advanced air warfare. A US Naval Academy graduate, his leadership career spans everything from operational combat to modernizing NATO doctrine; and from bilateral basing transformations in Asia to running the most complex US Navy installation in Europe supporting a multinational community of over 13,000 across 55 tenant organizations spanning multiple countries and continents. Today, he helps founders and executives design leadership systems that put decisions at the right level, hold alignment as the company grows, and build judgement at every layer. Founding Chairman of a stealth-mode EU defence startup; board advisor; University of Florida MBA; nearly 3,000 fighter hours and 500+ carrier-arrested landings.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/public/def37e66-3833-48b8-843a-733f9e6d0e48/1788867982307.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"PriFly Advisors"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/edchandler96/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Cíntia Costa","jobTitle":"President","description":"Cíntia is the President at the 351 Portuguese Startup Association. Working for over 10 years within the entrepreneurship and innovation ecosystem, she has a track record of helping startups, tech corporates, and incubators communicate across online platforms and media outlets, and grow their businesses.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/a81dd026-60db-44eb-9eac-70b2d424ebe0.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"351 Portuguese Startup Association"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/cintiatcosta/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Olivia Page","jobTitle":"CEO & Co-founder","description":"Olivia is the CEO and Co-Founder of Mykor, a biotechnology platform scaling mycelium into high-performance, bio-based construction materials. An architect by training with over a decade of bio-based construction experience—including delivering one of the first hempcrete residential developments in Portugal —Olivia founded Mykor in 2021 to replace harmful construction products. Under her leadership, Mykor has commercialised flagship products like the MykoSIP™ acoustic system, securing over $500M in off-take agreements with leading European contractors as the company expands from its pilot plant in Portugal to factories globally.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/605e7777-690f-4b4a-b49d-ba2d7d10c72b.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Mykor"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/olivia-page-09961299/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Olesia Rykova","jobTitle":"CEO & Co-founder","description":"Olesia Rykova is a Fractional CMO and brand strategist who builds brands using psychology, profiling, and psychodiagnostics — around consumer perception and behavioural prediction. Working in marketing since 2005, she's spent 20+ years working 1:1 with founders and C-suite leaders on positioning, personal-brand creation, and growth — from €100M–€600M holdings and Forbes-listed companies to early-stage startups. She leads marketing-project evaluation for a business accelerator, runs masterclasses for entrepreneur communities in Lisbon and beyond, mentors founders in the Women Leaders Circle, and teaches behavioural branding to entrepreneurs across 15+ countries. Her work includes a 2.5× profit turnaround and a founder brand taken from a year of zero sales to €1.1M in two months.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/a023c9bd-dc64-4623-87dd-5474e810be41.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"SOULBRANDING"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/olesia-rykova/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Joaquim Nascimento","jobTitle":"CEO & Co-founder","description":"Joaquim Nascimento is co-author of 'Como usar a IA para criar uma Startup em 30 dias (Edit'AI, 2026)', a method that treats AI as a decision tool rather than a building tool. He is CEO of Kapisci a US start-up and co-founder of PhorecastAI, both AI platforms for biopharma strategy, and President of Algarve Evolution, the leading innovation ecosystem in southern Portugal. He spent 17 years at Vanguard Strategy and six at AstraZeneca before returning to Portugal, and now teaches Digital Businesses at the University of Algarve. He founded the Algarve AI Community and holds Stanford's AI in Healthcare specialisation.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/ee745fb5-a3cd-441e-989b-3bf088c46f51.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Kapisci"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/joaquimnascimento"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Daniel Gouveia","jobTitle":"Business Developer Lead","description":"With a background rooted in digital ecosystems, commercial, and talent management, Daniel Gouveia spans diverse sectors, from enterprises like Super Bock Group and EDP to start ups/scale-ups in AI and emerging tech. Acting as a strategic thinking partner, he focuses on how technological advancement shapes organizations, leadership, and well-being.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/cff0f2de-a911-4791-a1d3-33339fe6ccc6.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Digiseg"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/danielgouveia/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Nataliia Komarnytska","jobTitle":"Head of Global PR","description":"I am a strategic communications and PR leader with over 10 years of experience supporting high-growth technology companies across the FinTech, blockchain, and Web3 ecosystem.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/dc9ceeac-4c30-46d3-9d77-5fb79885b9d6.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"IdeaSoft"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/natalykoma/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Brian Nogaro","jobTitle":"Director, Investor Relations","description":"Brian Nogaro is Director of Investor Relations at S8 Acquisition, where he works with investors building portfolios of government housing. Before that he led sales teams across security and energy businesses in Canada, and served as Past President of JCI Toronto. He’s a JCI-certified public speaker who likes keeping rooms moving","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/25d7fe18-5522-4916-bd9d-3757e82f19e1.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"S8 Aquisitions"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/brian-nogaro-29b18162/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Nina Chandé","jobTitle":"Founder","description":"Nina Chandé is a marketing procurement consultant with 20+ years across FMCG, retail and entertainment, including Unilever, Sainsbury's and Sky. She helps brands, agencies and founders negotiate, price and govern AI and marketing vendor relationships before they erode margin. This work has delivered €20m in year-on-year savings and up to 50% AI cost reduction across 29 global hubs. She runs Like No Other, her marketing procurement advisory practice and is now based in the Algarve.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/a5adf715-a165-4ed3-921e-4091eceaf377.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Like No Other"},"sameAs":["https://www.linkedin.com/in/ninachande/"]}</script>
    <script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Person","name":"Mike Sigal","jobTitle":"Founder","description":"Former 8x Founder (4 exits), Former Fintech VC (80+ deals). \nNow advisor/coach/NED to founders & emerging fund managers/CVCs.\nBuilding a studio/fund to support the next generation of asset-backed lenders in Europe.","image":"https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/2b9c418f-005a-4054-a02d-c70965f2d2a8.jpg","worksFor":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Sigal Ventures"},"sameAs":["http://www.linkedin.com/in/mikesigal"]}</script>
