          <p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45">Zoya Mesaric is an Executive Coach, Psychoanalyst, and Trauma Specialist working internationally across Vienna, Lisbon, and London. She helps founders, executives, and high-performing professionals navigate leadership, identity, performance, and psychological resilience. Her work has been presented at the World Congress for Psychotherapy, and she is a regular contributor to Elle Slovenia.</p>
