          <p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45">Founder & MD of Linkilaw Solicitors, a boutique Mayfair law firm specialising in complex, high-profile international disputes. Forbes 30 Under 30 honouree and The Times/LDC Top 50 To Watch. Over a decade advising entrepreneurs, investors, family offices and business leaders where law, leadership and international growth intersect. I speak on conscious leadership, organisational culture, entrepreneurship, cross-border business, and building values-driven organisations. My experience spans complex international structures, cross-border disputes and long-term growth strategies across multiple jurisdictions — with significant engagement in the UAE and wider Middle East. I deliver actionable insights grounded in real-world experience for audiences of founders, executives and investors.</p>
