          <p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45">A Marketing & Brand Strategist focused on consumer psychology and neuromarketing, drawing on experience working with SMEs across Spain on positioning, go-to-market strategy, and digital presence.

Román graduated with honours in Marketing from Universidad Complutense de Madrid, with academic and professional focus on how brands build trust and drive decisions at the point of choice.

At Startup Summit, he'll bring that lens to a practical question: how teams and founders can build real brand equity and go-to-market traction without a big budget behind them.</p>
