          <p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45">Saachin Bhatt CITP MBCS is a serial entrepreneur, innovation strategist, and keynote speaker who joined Accenture at 18 as a data scientist, becoming one of their youngest consultants globally by 21, delivering £15M in impact across national security, aerospace, and tier-1 banks. The youngest ever to achieve Chartered IT Professional status under the Royal Charter, he co-founded Brdge, an award-winning global consultancy and venture studio helping startups, scaleups, and SMEs access world-class AI and emerging tech expertise. He advises Fortune 500 CEOs on AI strategy and is Vice Chair & Governor at one of the UK's top-performing secondary schools.</p>
