          <p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:12px;opacity:0.75">Dyrectli Capital</p>
          <p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45">David Graham has spent 25 years as a founder, including four exits. He now runs Dyrectli Capital, an early-stage investment syndicate and advisory firm that connects post-MVP founders to capital and invests alongside exited founders and HNWIs. He reviews 3,000+ decks a year, has made around 40 investments over the past three years, and advises early-stage founders on what actually generates cash or closes deals.</p>
