        <div style="padding:14px">
          <h3 style="margin:0 0 4px;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.15">Tania Tome</h3>
          <p style="margin:0;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em">American Business Awards® Judge, Global KeynoteSpeaker, Advisor, Innovation Catalyst & Author</p>
          <p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:12px;opacity:0.75">BRANDULOGY</p>
          <p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45">Tânia Tomé is an internationally recognized Lusophone keynote speaker, economist, author and entrepreneur who has inspired audiences in more than 22 countries across Africa, Europe, North America and South America. She is Chair of the AI & Technology, New Product & Service, and Sustainability Awards Judging Committee for the 2026 Stevie® Awards for Women in Business, held in New York, and the first Lusophone and African woman to chair a Global Women in Business Awards judging committee in New York. A former Forbes Coaches Council member and recipient of an Academic Award presented by former Portuguese President Mário Soares, she serves as advisor, board member and international judge for several global initiatives.</p>
