      </a>
    </li>

    <li id="angelee-sidar" style="border:1px solid #e5e5e5;border-radius:12px;overflow:hidden;background:#FFCF00;color:#000">
      <a href="/speakers/angelee-sidar" style="display:block;text-decoration:none;color:inherit">
        <img src="https://vnhlwqsbozhgewgxwjik.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/speaker-headshots/applications/d9a800d3-7e60-4996-b0c0-fface2f6a72f.png" alt="Speaker portrait of Angelee SIDAR, Founder at FIIYS Ltd" width="480" height="480" loading="lazy" decoding="async" style="width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1/1;object-fit:cover;object-position:center top;display:block" />
        <div style="padding:14px">
          <h3 style="margin:0 0 4px;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.15">Angelee SIDAR</h3>
          <p style="margin:0;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0.06em">Founder</p>
          <p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:12px;opacity:0.75">FIIYS Ltd</p>
          <p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45">Angelee Sidar is an entrepreneur, keynote speaker and executive coach who helps founders "scale themselves so that they can scale their businesses."
After leaving a corporate career, Angelee built a contract catering company that disrupted a legacy industry, replacing soulless service with experiences centred on health and community. Within three years it reached seven figures and 12+ locations, working with brands including Nike, Adidas, IWG Group and Spaces, before the pandemic brought it to an end.
That loss became the catalyst for a deeper journey, reshaping how she saw ambition and success. Today she draws on neuroscience, nervous system regulation and her R.E.F. Method™ to help founders lead with clarity and build purpose.</p>
