          <p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45">I'm a TEDx speaker working on how founders and leaders generate ideas and make decisions when there's no precedent to copy. I built the Creativity Archetype Method (CAM) with the aid of AI — a diagnostic across 8 archetypes that identifies how a person creates and what blocks them, with a 3-minute version at quiz.daletchine.com. I spent my career among divergent thinkers, artists and collectors, advising on art investment: capital allocation under uncertainty, the same challenge founders in this room face. I lectured at La Cambre in Brussels and have led interviews and moderated panels with artists and entrepreneurs at Art Basel, the Sovereign Art Foundation, in New York, Moscow and Riyadh. 
(Based in Lisbon)</p>
