          <p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:12px;opacity:0.75">Growth Geek Unipessoal LDA</p>
          <p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45">Lidija Krickovic is the founder of Growth Geek and creator of the 20-Week Foundational Fixes Program, which helps post-raise and scaling companies replace operational chaos with the foundations required for sustainable growth. Across more than 20 years, she has led teams of 200+, grown annual profit from $10M to $24M as a CEO, and taken a venture from inception to a €20M+ valuation in under ten months. She also led internal execution and due diligence for a $40.8M exit, giving her a hands-on perspective on operational efficiency, scaling, and building companies with long-term enterprise value in mind.</p>
