          <p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:12px;opacity:0.75">Mykor</p>
          <p style="margin:0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.45">Olivia is the CEO and Co-Founder of Mykor, a biotechnology platform scaling mycelium into high-performance, bio-based construction materials. An architect by training with over a decade of bio-based construction experience—including delivering one of the first hempcrete residential developments in Portugal —Olivia founded Mykor in 2021 to replace harmful construction products. Under her leadership, Mykor has commercialised flagship products like the MykoSIP™ acoustic system, securing over $500M in off-take agreements with leading European contractors as the company expands from its pilot plant in Portugal to factories globally.</p>
